# Anything in public/ is served unauthenticated from the deployment. The
# display face is a commercial licence, so only the WOFF2 webfont ships --
# the .otf is the installable desktop binary and has no business being a
# public download. Converted by web/scripts/build_fonts.py; see the @font-face
# block in app/tokens.css.
public/fonts/*.otf
public/fonts/*.ttf
